/**
 * Everything the bot posts: swap details embed, wallet (unfinished swaps) embeds, the plain-text ⏳ / closing / "couldn't find" messages, and the /meson-query not-found embed.
 *
 * Addresses and hashes are shown in full rather than truncated — support staff copy them out — with a link to the relevant chain explorer alongside.
 */
